```cmd
git add README.md
git commit -m "docs: updated comprehensive README with API and DB schema"
git push
Push ho jaye toh batao, phir hum Backend ki pehli file (main.py, database.py) aur models ka actual code likhna shuru karte hain! 🚀

giginore file
Bhai, bahut badhiya point uthaya! Tumne .env files commit kar di hain jisme API keys aani hain. Unhe protect karna zaroori hai.

Chalo pehle .gitignore file set karte hain, aur phir jo .env files galti se track ho gayi hain unhe Git se hata dete hain (laptop se delete nahi hongi, bas Git unhe ignore karega).

Step 1: .gitignore file me content daalo
Apne project folder ke root me jo .gitignore file hai, usko open karo aur usme ye sab copy-paste kar do:

gitignore
